  "title": "Heather McCartney is born | 1962",
  "date": "1962-12-31",
  "content": "<div class=\"ast-post-format- single-layout-1\"><div class=\"entry-content clear\" itemprop=\"text\"><p>Heather Louise McCartney was born in Tucson, Arizona, on 31 December 1962. <span id=\"more-131736\"></span></p><p>Her birth parents were <a href=\"/people/linda-mccartney/\">Linda Eastman</a> and her then-husband Joseph Melville See Jr, who married in June 1962 and divorced in 1965.</p><p>In 1967 Eastman moved to England with Heather, with See making no objection to her having full custody. Linda met <a href=\"/people/paul-mccartney/\">Paul McCartney</a> and the pair married on <a href=\"/1969/03/12/paul-mccartney-marries-linda-eastman/\">12 March 1969</a>. McCartney adopted Heather that same year with See’s approval.</p><p><a href=\"/gallery/1969-photos/690126-get-back_16/\" rel=\"attachment wp-att-101981\"><img data-lazyloaded=\"1\" src=\"data:image/svg+xml;base64,PHN2ZyB4bWxucz0iaHR0cDovL3d3dy53My5vcmcvMjAwMC9zdmciIHdpZHRoPSI4MDAiIGhlaWdodD0iNDMyIiB2aWV3Qm94PSIwIDAgODAwIDQzMiI+PHJlY3Qgd2lkdGg9IjEwMCUiIGhlaWdodD0iMTAwJSIgZmlsbD0iI2NmZDRkYiIvPjwvc3ZnPg==\" decoding=\"async\" data-attachment-id=\"101981\" data-permalink=\"https://www.beatlesbible.com/gallery/1969-photos/690126-get-back_16/\" data-orig-file=\"https://www.beatlesbible.com/wp/media/690126-get-back_16.jpg\" data-orig-size=\"1920,1036\" data-comments-opened=\"1\" data-image-title=\"Heather Eastman – Apple Studios, 26 January 1969\" data-image-description=\"\" data-image-caption=\"\" data-large-file=\"https://www.beatlesbible.com/wp/media/690126-get-back_16-960x518.jpg\" data-src=\"/wp/media/690126-get-back_16-960x518.jpg\" alt=\"Heather Eastman – Apple Studios, 26 January 1969\" width=\"800\" height=\"432\" class=\"aligncenter size-large wp-image-101981\" data-srcset=\"https://www.beatlesbible.com/wp/media/690126-get-back_16-960x518.jpg 960w, https://www.beatlesbible.com/wp/media/690126-get-back_16-580x313.jpg 580w, https://www.beatlesbible.com/wp/media/690126-get-back_16-200x108.jpg 200w, https://www.beatlesbible.com/wp/media/690126-get-back_16-768x414.jpg 768w, https://www.beatlesbible.com/wp/media/690126-get-back_16-1536x829.jpg 1536w, https://www.beatlesbible.com/wp/media/690126-get-back_16.jpg 1920w\" data-sizes=\"(max-width: 800px) 100vw, 800px\"></a></p><p>The young Heather appeared in The Beatles’ final film, <em>Let It Be</em>, which was filmed in January 1969, although she largely stayed out of the public eye in later years.</p><p>Heather studied printing at the Photographers’ Workshop in Covent Garden, London, before studying pottery and design and becoming a potter. She later launched a houseware line called Heather McCartney Designs.</p><div data-carousel-extra=\"{&quot;blog_id&quot;:1,&quot;permalink&quot;:&quot;https://www.beatlesbible.com/1962/12/31/heather-mccartney-born/&quot;}\" id=\"gallery-1\" class=\"gallery galleryid-131736 gallery-columns-3 gallery-size-thumbnail\"><figure class=\"gallery-item\"><div class=\"gallery-icon landscape\">\n<a href=\"https://www.beatlesbible.com/gallery/1969-photos/690126-get-back_74/\"><img data-lazyloaded=\"1\" src=\"data:image/svg+xml;base64,PHN2ZyB4bWxucz0iaHR0cDovL3d3dy53My5vcmcvMjAwMC9zdmciIHdpZHRoPSIyMDAiIGhlaWdodD0iMTA4IiB2aWV3Qm94PSIwIDAgMjAwIDEwOCI+PHJlY3Qgd2lkdGg9IjEwMCUiIGhlaWdodD0iMTAwJSIgZmlsbD0iI2NmZDRkYiIvPjwvc3ZnPg==\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"200\" height=\"108\" data-src=\"https://www.beatlesbible.com/wp/media/690126-get-back_74-200x108.jpg\" class=\"attachment-thumbnail size-thumbnail\" alt=\"Linda Eastman, Heather Eastman, Paul McCartney, Glyn Johns – Apple Studios, 26 January 1969\" data-srcset=\"https://www.beatlesbible.com/wp/media/690126-get-back_74-200x108.jpg 200w, https://www.beatlesbible.com/wp/media/690126-get-back_74-580x313.jpg 580w, https://www.beatlesbible.com/wp/media/690126-get-back_74-960x518.jpg 960w, https://www.beatlesbible.com/wp/media/690126-get-back_74-768x414.jpg 768w, https://www.beatlesbible.com/wp/media/690126-get-back_74-1536x829.jpg 1536w, https://